# desktop-amd64.pkgs — amd64-only overlay to manifests/desktop.pkgs.
#
# Unioned into the offline desktop closure by build-desktop-mirror.sh ONLY
# when ARCH=amd64 (see SEEDFILE_ARCH_OVERLAY there). These packages do not
# exist for arm64 in the Ubuntu archive (or are meaningless on CIX Sky1
# hardware), so they cannot live in the shared manifests/desktop.pkgs
# without breaking the arm64 closure resolve.
#
# NVIDIA proprietary GPU driver stack — installed at runtime by
# post-install/86-gpu-nvidia.sh. Version pin (595) matches that hook's
# fallback; both should be bumped together if the archive's recommended
# version moves on. See 86-gpu-nvidia.sh for the ubuntu-drivers-devices
# verification this was based on (PEGASUS RTX 2060 Mobile, 2026-07-27).
nvidia-driver-595-open
libnvidia-gl-595
nvidia-prime
nvidia-settings
mesa-vulkan-drivers
